{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.2"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-018",
    "title": "被删去的年代"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_096",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "他将灯交给一名白发老妇，又把一枚铜环埋入土中。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "黑铁门后的拖行声停了。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2878,
          "end": 2878
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灵脉城重新陷入寂静，只有陆照临掌心那道白光仍沿石纹缓慢流动。白光经过每一块青砖，便留下一枚极淡的圆印，像有人正在城中铺开一条看不见的路。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2880,
          "end": 2880
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离蹲在裂缝旁，用铜针轻轻刮开石屑。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2882,
          "end": 2882
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "石屑下的“顾”字逐渐完整，后面跟着一个被削掉的偏旁。她盯着那个缺口，脸色没有变化，眼神却像被冻住。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2884,
          "end": 2884
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你认识这个印？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2886,
          "end": 2886
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏旁支的旧印。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2888,
          "end": 2888
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁用过？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2890,
          "end": 2890
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所有参与灵脉封存的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2892,
          "end": 2892
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你叔父？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2894,
          "end": 2894
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他是账房，不是修士。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2896,
          "end": 2896
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“账房为什么会参与封存？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2898,
          "end": 2898
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离没有回答。她从腰间解下铜环，放在裂缝旁。铜环的断面与石片缺口严丝合缝，青光触碰铜环时，四周的石楼同时传来轻微震动。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2900,
          "end": 2900
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "窗后的无脸人抬起手，开始敲击窗框。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2902,
          "end": 2902
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2904,
          "end": 2904
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "两下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2906,
          "end": 2906
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第三下还未响起，叶观澜便按住了陆照临的肩：“别让它们数完。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2908,
          "end": 2908
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“数完会怎样？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2910,
          "end": 2910
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“城心开门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2912,
          "end": 2912
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这不是我们要的吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2914,
          "end": 2914
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "铜片展开后是一份工程清单：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2940,
          "end": 2940
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“灵脉城封存：东门、南门、城心灯柱七座；经手顾氏三人，玄霄宗一人，归墟盟一人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2942,
          "end": 2942
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "姓名一栏全部被划去，只剩三种印记。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2944,
          "end": 2944
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离盯着顾氏印记，指尖开始发白。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2946,
          "end": 2946
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这里写着三人。”她说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2948,
          "end": 2948
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你叔父是其中之一？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2950,
          "end": 2950
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2952,
          "end": 2952
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她把清单递给他。清单最后一行注明：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2954,
          "end": 2954
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封存完成后，所有经手人不得保留原名，不得返回人间。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2956,
          "end": 2956
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临抬头：“这就是无灯镇说的没有名字的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2958,
          "end": 2958
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻不知何时走到他们身后：“不是失去名字，是名字被拿去填补灵脉。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2960,
          "end": 2960
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“名字还能填补灵脉？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2962,
          "end": 2962
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“太虚遗脉不认血肉，只认被世界记住的东西。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2964,
          "end": 2964
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以你们把人的名字给了它？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2966,
          "end": 2966
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“当时只有这个办法。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2968,
          "end": 2968
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁决定的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2970,
          "end": 2970
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻转动无相铜镜。镜面浮出三道模糊身影，分别站在城心灯柱旁。顾氏身影将一盏灯推入地下，玄霄宗身影举剑封门，归墟盟身影则把一张写满名字的纸撕成两半。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2972,
          "end": 2972
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三方共同决定。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2974,
          "end": 2974
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离忽然笑了一下，笑意冷得像冰：“你们每个人都说自己别无选择。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2976,
          "end": 2976
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻没有辩解：“选择的代价，总要有人承担。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2978,
          "end": 2978
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“于是让他们失去名字？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2980,
          "end": 2980
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“于是让后来的人活着。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2982,
          "end": 2982
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "石楼中传来第三声敲击。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2984,
          "end": 2984
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "黑色蜡片裂开，窗后的无脸人同时转头。它们的手臂穿过窗框，向街心伸来。每一只手腕上都缠着黑色铜丝，铜丝尽头连向城心。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2986,
          "end": 2986
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜拔出短刃，割断最近的一根铜丝。无脸人立刻向后仰倒，窗框里溅出一片青白粉末。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2988,
          "end": 2988
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不能全断。”慧闻说，“它们会把城心一起拉醒。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2990,
          "end": 2990
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离把铜片塞进陆照临手里：“带走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2992,
          "end": 2992
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2994,
          "end": 2994
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我要找顾氏的名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2996,
          "end": 2996
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“清单上已经被划掉。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2998,
          "end": 2998
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“划掉不等于不存在。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3000,
          "end": 3000
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她转身冲向城心，铜针在指间连成一线。叶观澜拦住她：“城心的灯还没点。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3002,
          "end": 3002
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以才要去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3004,
          "end": 3004
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“点灯会让你看见家族真正做过的事。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3006,
          "end": 3006
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我已经看见他们做过的第一件事。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3008,
          "end": 3008
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离抬头看向黑铁门：“他们把人交给了门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3010,
          "end": 3010
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆照临。”叶观澜低声道，“你必须决定跟谁走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-069",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3014,
          "end": 3014
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们不能一起？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-070",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3016,
          "end": 3016
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“门只允许一个方向。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-071",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3018,
          "end": 3018
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "所有无脸人同时停下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-077",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3030,
          "end": 3030
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "极冷。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-093",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3063,
          "end": 3063
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“冬至前七日，三名引灯人入城，携第二盏……”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3113,
          "end": 3113
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "后半行被削掉。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3115,
          "end": 3115
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第二盏灯后来去了哪里？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3117,
          "end": 3117
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻看向顾长离：“有人把它送回了人间。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3119,
          "end": 3119
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3121,
          "end": 3121
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏旁支的一名经手人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3123,
          "end": 3123
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离的手指缓慢收紧：“我叔父？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3125,
          "end": 3125
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你叔父不是修士，却最擅长记账。他把每一盏灯的去向写在账上，直到有人要求他把自己的名字也写进去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3127,
          "end": 3127
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他答应了？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3129,
          "end": 3129
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他拒绝了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3131,
          "end": 3131
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“然后呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3133,
          "end": 3133
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻没有回答。无相铜镜中，一段新的影像浮出：一个佩着顾氏铜环的男人站在城心，手里捧着第二盏灯。他将灯交给一名白发老妇，又把一枚铜环埋入土中。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3135,
          "end": 3135
        }
      }
    ],
